            <div xml:id="d316">

                <pb facs="0423" n="343" sameAs="frus:frus1930v01/pg343"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/1120: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Paraguay</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Wheeler</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Asunción</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-09-12T15:00:00-03:50">September 12, 1930—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received September 13—6:55 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>70. My telegram No. 65, August 14, 3 p.m.<anchor n="74a" xml:id="d316-f1"/>
                    Zubizarreta has several times asked me if I have received any word from you
                    giving your opinion as to the best time for the opening of the conversations at
                    Washington.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wheeler</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
